# Cursor Rules & Standards

- **TypeScript:** Strict mode enabled. Discriminated unions for UI states: `idle` | `loading` | `success` | `error`.
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS only. Avoid inline style blocks unless calculating dynamic CSS transform values.
- **Color Token Enforcement:** Use only brand-specific tokens: `navy-950`, `navy-900`, `gold-500`, `crimson-800`, `parchment`.
- **Imports Order:**
  1. React & Next.js core modules
  2. Third-party packages (Framer Motion, Lucide icons)
  3. Local components (`@/components/...`)
  4. Services & Database clients (`@/lib/...`)
  5. Types & Interfaces (`@/types/...`)
- **Accessibility:** All `<button>` and `<input>` elements must include `aria-label`, visible focus rings (`focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-gold-500`), and accessible color contrast ratios (> 4.5:1).
